placed on the sides using a cushion. It is large and thin, though there are many variations in size and shape. It is soft when fresh but is often dried. Lavash is common to the cuisines of South Caucasus and West Asia. It is a staple food in Armenia, eastern Georgia, and parts of Iran."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"ingredient-lavash"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lavash"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's cooked with","count":2,"groups":[["Arab cuisine","cuisine/arab-cuisine",[["Shawarma","dish/shawarma"]]],["Turkish cuisine","cuisine/turkish-cuisine",[["İskender kebap","dish/iskender-kebap"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Lamb","ingredient/lamb"],["Pita","ingredient/pita"],["Butter","ingredient/butter"],["Tomato sauce","ingredient/tomato-sauce"],["Yogurt","ingredient/yogurt"],["Beef","ingredient/beef"],["Cardamom","ingredient/cardamom"],["Chicken","ingredient/chicken"],["Cinnamon","ingredient/cinnamon"],["Laffa","ingredient/laffa"],["Mentha","ingredient/mentha"],["Morkovcha","ingredient/morkovcha"],["Paprika","ingredient/paprika"],["Syzygium","ingredient/syzygium"],["Taboon bread","ingredient/taboon-bread"],["Turkey meat","ingredient/turkey-meat"]]}],"img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/b/b9/Pan_armenio_en_el_mercado_de_Yerevan.JPG/500px-Pan_armenio_en_el_mercado_de_Yerevan.JPG","w":500,"h":375,"by":"Wiquijote","lic":"Public domain","licUrl":"","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pan_armenio_en_el_mercado_de_Yerevan.JPG"}},"dish/jibarito":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/jibarito","n":"Jibarito","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from American cuisine","dot":"#94bd5c","intro":[["The jibarito is a sandwich originating from Chicago’s Puerto Rican community. It is made with flattened, fried green plantains instead of bread, aioli, and a filling consisting of meat, cheese (generally American), lettuce, tomato, and sometimes onion and crushed garlic. The original jibarito had a steak filling, and that remains the predominant variety, but other ingredients, such as chicken and pork, are also common."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-jibarito"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jibarito"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["American cuisine","cuisine/american-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":7,"links":[["Cheese","ingredient/cheese"],["Cooking banana","ingredient/cooking-banana"],["Garlic","ingredient/garlic"],["Lettuce","ingredient/lettuce"],["Mayonnaise","ingredient/mayonnaise"],["Plantain (cooking)","ingredient/plantain-cooking"],["Tomato","ingredient/tomato"]]},{"h":"More from American cuisine","links":[["Angel food cake","dish/angel-food-cake"],["Banana bread","dish/banana-bread"],["Banana pudding","dish/banana-pudding"],["Barbecue sauce","dish/barbecue-sauce"],["Beer cake","dish/beer-cake"],["Better than sex cake","dish/better-than-sex-cake"],["Blini","dish/blini"],["Blooming onion","dish/blooming-onion"],["Brown Betty (dessert)","dish/brown-betty-dessert"],["Brunswick stew","dish/brunswick-stew"],["Buffalo wing","dish/buffalo-wing"],["Butter cake","dish/butter-cake"],["Caesar salad","dish/caesar-salad"],["Caramel apple","dish/caramel-apple"],["Carbonara","dish/carbonara"],["Cheesesteak","dish/cheesesteak"],["Chicago-style hot dog","dish/chicago-style-hot-dog"],["Chicken nugget","dish/chicken-nugget"],["Chiffon cake","dish/chiffon-cake"],["Chili con carne","dish/chili-con-carne"],["Chimichanga","dish/chimichanga"],["Chow-chow (food)","dish/chow-chow-food"],["Chowder","dish/chowder"],["Cioppino","dish/cioppino"],["Clam chowder","dish/clam-chowder"],["Clam dip","dish/clam-dip"],["Club sandwich","dish/club-sandwich"],["Cobb salad","dish/cobb-salad"],["Cobbler (food)","dish/cobbler-food"],["Cook's Corner","dish/cook-s-corner"],["Crab cake","dish/crab-cake"],["Croffle","dish/croffle"],["Dagwood Bumstead","dish/dagwood-bumstead"],["Dagwood sandwich","dish/dagwood-sandwich"],["Deep-dish pizza","di